{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":29.950000762939453,"text":"Honestly my whole weekend is in this bag right now. This is the Weekender from Volantra. It's a Birkin inspired shape that they scaled up into a travel bag and there's no logo on it anywhere. Jackets Veronica Beer, trousers are frame and the hat has no brand. The cuff is David Uriman and the watch is a Rolex. It holds three days worth of clothes and it still fits in the overhead bin which is all I need.","words":[{"word":"Honestly","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":1.3799999952316284},{"word":"my","start":1.3799999952316284,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"whole","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.140000104904175},{"word":"weekend","start":2.140000104904175,"end":2.2799999713897705},{"word":"is","start":2.2799999713897705,"end":2.619999885559082},{"word":"in","start":2.619999885559082,"end":2.7200000286102295},{"word":"this","start":2.7200000286102295,"end":2.9600000381469727},{"word":"bag","start":2.9600000381469727,"end":3.140000104904175},{"word":"right","start":3.140000104904175,"end":3.4600000381469727},{"word":"now","start":3.4600000381469727,"end":3.700000047683716},{"word":"This","start":4.460000038146973,"end":4.699999809265137},{"word":"is","start":4.699999809265137,"end":5.039999961853027},{"word":"the","start":5.039999961853027,"end":5.360000133514404},{"word":"Weekender","start":5.360000133514404,"end":5.679999828338623},{"word":"from","start":5.679999828338623,"end":6.139999866485596},{"word":"Volantra","start":5.900000095367432,"end":6.539999961853027},{"word":"It's","start":7.340000152587891,"end":7.559999942779541},{"word":"a","start":7.559999942779541,"end":8.119999885559082},{"word":"Birkin","start":8.119999885559082,"end":8.119999885559082},{"word":"inspired","start":8.119999885559082,"end":8.739999771118164},{"word":"shape","start":8.739999771118164,"end":9.15999984741211},{"word":"that","start":9.15999984741211,"end":9.539999961853027},{"word":"they","start":9.5399